meta {
  name: Search Manga
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=one piece
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  q: one piece
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body: isDefined
}

docs {
  # Search Manga
  Searches MangaKatana catalog for manga matching the given search query string `q`.

  ### Query Parameters
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |-----------|------|----------|-------------|
  | `q` | string | **Yes** | Search keyword or title query (e.g. `one piece`, `bleach`). |

  ### Responses
  - **`200 OK`**: Returns a JSON array of matching manga items.
    ```json
    [
      {
        "id": "one-piece.49",
        "title": "One Piece",
        "alt_titles": ["OP", "Wan Pīsu"],
        "description": "Gol D. Roger was known as the 'Pirate King'...",
        "authors": ["Oda Eiichiro"],
        "artists": ["Oda Eiichiro"],
        "genres": ["Action", "Adventure", "Comedy", "Shounen"],
        "status": "Ongoing",
        "cover_url": "https://img.mangakatana.com/covers/..."
      }
    ]
    ```
  - **`400 Bad Request`**: If the `q` query parameter is missing.
}
